        lowerCourtProblems: 'Absence of resident directors following managing director demise; inability to update BRELA ORS profile or file returns since 2017.',
        whyArgumentsAcceptedRejected: 'First request accepted as administrators possess statutory title to deceased interests; Second and third requests refused due to lack of precise dates and evidence regarding untraceability period of foreign shareholders.',
        conclusionPathway: 'Partial grant: recognizing representative rights in the deceased shareholding while declining unilateral register alteration without joining BRELA and untraceable shareholders.'
