        'Status of the CMA: The CMA is a quasi-judicial administrative body, not a court under the Government Proceedings Act.',
        'Immunity from CMA for AG/Government: The Attorney General and Government (including TANAPA) cannot be sued before the CMA without an explicit statutory grant of jurisdiction.',
