        'Public Service Remedies: Public servants must exhaust statutory internal appeal machinery under the Public Service Act and seek judicial review before the High Court rather than restarting disputes before the CMA.',
        'Mandatory CMA Form No. 10: Lodging CMA Form No. 10 under Regulation 34(1) is a mandatory condition precedent to a competent labour revision application.',
        'Suo Motu Nullification: The High Court invoked its inherent and statutory revisional powers under Rule 28(1) of the Labour Court Rules to nullify the CMA proceedings for complete want of jurisdiction.'
