        background: 'Majuto Ngamba, Edward Maganga, and Paschal January were jointly indicted for the murder of Keflin daughter of Masanja on 26 January 2020 at Segese Village, Kahama District. The prosecution alleged that the trio invaded the deceased\'s residence at approximately 1:00 a.m. and attacked her with sharp machetes, causing severe lacerations and fatal haemorrhagic shock.',
