        respondent: 'TRA (represented by Mr. Hospis Maswanyia, Senior State Attorney) argued that the demand letter dated 24 January 2017 was the decision challenged by Lakairo, the review application filed on 1 March 2017 was outside the prescribed 30 days, an incompetent application cannot trigger statutory deeming provisions, the date of demand was never disputed before the Board, and the appeal should be dismissed.'
