      proceduralHistory: '16 May 1988: Mchami employed/seconded to Makumira -> 23 January 2006: Makumira Governing Board decided to stop his service at Makumira and return him to Iringa Diocese; Bishop Akyoo announced decision -> Industrial Court Inquiry No. 145 of 2006 (Full Bench held Mchami was on secondment and returned to diocese rather than terminated) -> Labour Complaint No. 04 of 2013 (instituted for defamation; lengthy trial with 5 complainant and 4 defence witnesses) -> 29 December 2023: High Court dismissed complaint without costs as a labour matter.',
