        respondentArguments: 'Mr. Fredrick Mwankinga argued that: (1) The applicant failed to account for every single day of delay; (2) No proof of follow-up (reminders, stamped letters, court registers) was tendered between 8 November 2023 and 1 August 2024; (3) No proof was provided that the number was supplied on 1 August 2024; (4) No notice of appeal or certified copies were requested; (5) The delay of over 200 days was excessive and born of negligence; (6) The application should be dismissed with costs.'
