        'Heirs refused to consent to the appellant’s appointment; only Robert Mangana Makwaia (filed late on 18 June 2019) and Jordan Rashidi Mangana (a minor) provided purported consent.',
        'The required affidavits explaining the absence of consent from other heirs were not filed with the petition on 20 March 2019, but submitted belatedly.',
