        'Jabir was alleged to have sold the property as administrator of the estate of the original owner, the late Hamis Jabir.',
        'The first respondent relied on a letter of offer dated 24 June 1986, transfer of right of occupancy, land-rent receipts (1999–2022), and a notice to vacate dated 22 April 2008.',
