        'The deceased had one known son, Moses Mushumbusi Kashonda, who predeceased his father, leaving two children: applicant Anatoli Moses Kashonda and his younger sister Annamaria Kashonda.',
        'On 15 November 2024, a family meeting nominated the respondents (Philbert Muhigi Kashonda and Julius Rweyemamu Kalokora) to administer the estate.',
        'The respondents filed Probate and Administration Cause No. 8913 of 2025, listing Anatoli, Annamaria, and Catherine Kashonda (described as a daughter) as beneficiaries.',
