          passageIndex: 1,
          text: 'APPLICATION FOR EXTENSION OF TIME: Misc. Civil Application No. 000018813 of 2024 filed by Charles Mbwana under Section 14(1) of the Law of Limitation Act to appeal against a matrimonial decree in Matrimonial Cause No. 66 of 2009 of the District Court of Temeke.',
