          text: 'HELD BY S.D. MWAIPOPO, J.: Under the Lyamuya Construction principles, an applicant alleging technical delays in obtaining an electronic reference number must demonstrate prompt and continuous follow-up efforts with documentary evidence. Bare allegations of verbal follow-ups without reminder letters or proof of receipt fail to account for every period of delay. Moreover, an alleged failure to properly appreciate evidence does not constitute an apparent illegality on the face of the record under Devram Valambhia.',
